<title>SINGAPORE: CLIPSAL UNIT TO SUPPLY COMMONWEALTH GAMES.</title>
<headline>CLIPSAL UNIT TO SUPPLY COMMONWEALTH GAMES.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clipsal Industries (Holdings) Ltd said on Friday its unit Clipsal (Malaysia) Sdn Bhd had been appointed to supply electrical accessories for the Commonwealth Games to be held in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia in 1998.</p>
<p>It said in a statement Clipsal Malaysia would provide an extensive range of branded electrical accessories to the games.</p>
<p>Clipsal, a member company of Gold Peak Industries (Holdings) Ltd is principally engaged in the development, manufacture and marketing of electrical installation products.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 870-3080)</p>
<p>--email Singapore.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
